    <description>F-34: Launched from the Quote &quot;Link BAN&quot; action. Lists the Active BANs that satisfy every criterion of the required lookup filter on Quote.BillingAccount__c (Account, Subsidiary, Currency, Invoice Frequency). The table selection is the choice: select a row and click Next to link that BAN; click Next with no row selected to create a new BAN via the unchanged BillingAccount_Screen_CreateBAN subflow. BANs awaiting Finance approval are shown as a read-only note - they become linkable once approved. When no Active BAN fits, the flow goes straight to create. Creating a BAN does not link it: the rep returns and links it after approval.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fml_PendingListClean</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(LEN({!var_PendingList}) &gt; 2, LEFT({!var_PendingList}, LEN({!var_PendingList}) - 2), &quot;&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
